      },
      "message": "fix(verify): a model that is only the stock's source is not judged as the part\n\nA casting copied into a FromModel stock and left in the tree was read\nby the program verdict as the finished part, so every cut into it was\na gouge. stock_source::stock_only_model names the one model that is\nthe source of every program setup's stock, named by no operation,\nwhile an operation names a separate part; part_facets_as_modelled and\nparts_facets_in leave it out. Every other document keeps today's\nverdict. Rule and dropped readings in\ndocs/decisions/1094-stock-source-not-part.md.\n\nFixes #1094\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
